  <item>
    <title>Vol.008 生日特辑｜当一个女人醒在32岁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c88cd7b977fb2c477d047b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c88cd7b977fb2c477d047b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 02:33:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>哇，写下标题还是给了自己“亿”点小小的震撼😅《一个女人》《32岁》……嘻嘻嘻，真是两个👍大好词！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>-</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>不管是新路人 还是老朋友，感谢你的收听 🛤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是我的</span><strong><span>生日</span></strong><span>🎂，也祝你 </span><strong><span>今天愉快</span></strong><span>～🌷☕️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💌 特别鸣谢：</span></strong><span>「本期校对」锵锵 </span><strong><span>&amp;</span></strong><span> 「首听嘉宾」锵锵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚞 - 导 航 轴 - 🧭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> </span><strong><span>开场：</span></strong><span>“我会不时回听你的播客，不知道自己情绪这样的起伏是好是坏……” ☔️ ⛰️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 🗺️ 本期关键词：</span><strong><span>存在主义危机、创伤、亲密关系</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕳️【存在主义危机】</span></strong><span>将当下抛入黑洞，自我摧毁——</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“来路作废，前路不明”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 我不过是别人哪里需要 哪里搬的砖 🧱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 《怪奇物语》（</span><strong><span>Max</span></strong><span>）👻 </span><em><strong><span>我的内心，是一片坟地</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 当痛苦来袭，</span><strong><span>Max：</span></strong><span>“躲在光里” ❤️‍🩹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 了解</span><strong><span>心理创伤</span></strong><span>，不为</span><strong><span>审判</span></strong><span>或</span><strong><span>厌弃自己</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>是为</span><strong><span>“内心恶魔”画像</span></strong><span>——把它曝光于</span><strong><span>认知</span></strong><span>的强光，解放被控制的</span><strong><span>情绪 🪼</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">27:31</a> </span><strong><span>健康的亲密关系</span></strong><span>就像“永动机”，关系本身强韧、有生命力：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大家做彼此的“父母”和“小孩” ❤️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👩🏻‍❤️‍👩🏻【亲密关系】</span></strong><span>原来我需要并依赖我的伴侣，而健康的亲密关系，也确实给我足够的安全感与成长 🌈</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>* 情感成熟v.s.情感不成熟人的特征（之一）：</span></strong></em><em><span>情感成熟的人，能予以对方安慰、支持；并承认，他们自己同样需要依赖别人、渴望亲密与安慰。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>--《不成熟的父母》本书解读，欢迎收听【id：关注精神健康】！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">28:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> 《怪奇物语》（</span><strong><span>Holly</span></strong><span>）😱 回避太久，看见“真实自我”，</span><em><strong><span>仿佛醒在噩梦里</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 关于：</span><strong><span>自我、自信、自洽</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 我终于！知道自己</span><strong><span>为啥要“变美”</span></strong><span>啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🙇🏻‍♀️</span><strong><span>【犯错-道歉】</span></strong><span>情感不成熟的人，无法接受、承认自己的“错误”——那会让他们本就</span><strong><span>脆弱的“自我”产生绝望的动摇 😶‍🌫️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> </span><strong><span>任何错误，都能“摧毁”</span></strong><span>(内核不稳的)</span><strong><span>我</span></strong><span> 🫨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2867">47:47</a> 😭 我为何会像小孩一样：</span><strong><span>边哭边道歉？</span></strong><span>(附：AI解答)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2872">47:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2988">49:48</a> </span><strong><span>“CPTSD幸存者”</span></strong><span>的：</span><strong><span>母女相处之道</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> 结尾：</span></strong><span>30岁以后，心智才慢慢成长、成熟，并伴随剧烈的</span><strong><span>“生长痛”🩸 但很爽，请坚持！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>坚持不住的时候，来听听我吧—— 如果我从破破烂烂，到开满鲜花💐</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，你也可以❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈公益机构/指路：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G0QJzAmUopMB5Q_DQr4AlA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G0QJzAmUopMB5Q_DQr4AlA"><span>陪你心理</span></a><span>（可线上）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📱如有需要，可添加小助手（relaxrexian）具体详询</span></p><span></span><p><span>不开心的时候，来看看我们的🐱吧——全网🔍 豆来咪🌈</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmP9cojv9a7G2GC635XJmSOUQr-2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🍠： </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ec86590000000000101e564?xsec_token=YBRJGpyF4W83_VBoyQ2V_Hk3djZVGoYnQyEt9RQH1Uaqo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6405abaa000000001f033b3a&amp;apptime=1743177362&amp;share_id=f471a128c3934347a2003b0e5f8ada2f" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ec86590000000000101e564?xsec_token=YBRJGpyF4W83_VBoyQ2V_Hk3djZVGoYnQyEt9RQH1Uaqo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6405abaa000000001f033b3a&amp;apptime=1743177362&amp;share_id=f471a128c3934347a2003b0e5f8ada2f"><span>豆来咪🌈</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🫘：豆来咪🌈</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤍 不要放弃，再为自己，坚持一次。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxUFjmgnN8O2AxmdiMqKrkBmUZQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎼 BGM：Running Up That Hill (A Deal With God)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61ecd7ebab975b0640c5519c/lp5SlsNxTD3_VKkex5frZeNhXcZX.m4a" length="52016213" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:33</itunes:duration>
