  <item>
    <title>Vol.007《非穷尽列举》观影谈｜【剧透】直面女性“非穷尽”难题与思考</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ad743b5b2d0ed069f972c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ad743b5b2d0ed069f972c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Mar 2026 13:21:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>⚠️ </span><strong><span>本期节目「剧透预警！」——请观看后再来收听，也欢迎留言区和我们一起讨论！🎤 👏 🙌🏻</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>💐 所有姐妹们—— </span><strong><span>三八妇女节</span></strong><span>快乐！🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 昨天，我和锵一口气连看2部</span><strong><span>“女性主义”电影</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔘《暗黑新娘》 &nbsp;&nbsp;🔘《非穷尽列举》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💪🏻 强推《非穷尽列举》！！太过瘾了～</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loXVb8xCo2Agp02OyhJkm8kvda0S.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FttGExbPymtEeMwV57diQ1FsKuzx.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🧩 时间轴 🗺️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> 苏西·米勒——</span><strong><span>“法律三部曲”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（1）《初步举证》（2）《非穷尽列举》（3）《我所知的一切》（待命名）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 人物介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>女主/妻子=Jessica刑事法官 v.s. 丈夫=Michael皇家律师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>* 论夫妻职场的地位差异对家庭关系的影响：）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 【开幕】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jessica（裴淳华）“摇滚”女法官</span><strong><span>Slay全场</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtA1Q1_60pD7QWAc8xuVfT_vWgXw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 【转场】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>从「法庭」到「家庭」，忙如陀螺的“高能量”女性工作-生活日常</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>* 男宝妈=女权主义者=刑事大法官？</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhT30q28CQNsMnX4qnk99IVgBJsI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 【职场&amp;家庭女性】：活在所有人的需求缝隙中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 所有家事</span><strong><span>第一时间“找妈”</span></strong><span>——到底是谁规定的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 第一场激烈【戏剧冲突】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>💔 面对恶果：</span><strong><span>互相指责的夫妻，脆弱的父母</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 被</span><strong><span>“愧疚”</span></strong><span>裹挟的女性</span><strong><span>总在自省</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>☔️ </span><strong><span>“我是不是不够好”、“我本该做得更好”</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu328H4iD_LpNGbz9QrAVgwJl5J9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 映后采访 裴淳华：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>- 现实世界你身边亲手带大的孩子，也同样生活在你所不知的网络世界中。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>- 养育孩子，从来不仅是一个家庭的事情，整个社会都有其应当承担的责任。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkRt-1paLLqSLFH0k1p_dZGkKPbC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> </span><strong><span>《混沌少年时》：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>普通善良的父母，为何会养出</span><strong><span>“恶魔之子”</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi5wTJG93nf3bb6z-052QcV0USKt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 【揭秘时刻】：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>*「剧透预警！」——儿子到底有没有犯法？！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>* 他给出的原因竟然是……</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 人在无语的时候，真挺无语的……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> </span><strong><span>Jessica的决择：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>* 欢迎留言讨论——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>她到底是为了保住女法官的身份？还是为了儿子的后半生？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 为什么说：这部</span><strong><span>现实</span></strong><span>题材戏剧竟是</span><strong><span>“童话”</span></strong><span>结尾？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> 女性，是命运共同体</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgpGy4C5HY3VfXgl8_q8c8_0R2fs.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>图源：见水印，感谢绘者❤️</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 本期bgm：Unstoppable-Sia</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61ecd7ebab975b0640c5519c/ltHJr9IN47Ac1wWk_QaTXcbvl8UK.m4a" length="34130694" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fplq1ZXMJOZmSdt9MZbg_gdJYMqh.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.006 真的活在春天了｜31岁，我决定“享福”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e6c8498eecdbeb60c7d7d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e6c8498eecdbeb60c7d7d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Mar 2025 18:49:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不管是新路人还是老朋友，感谢你的收听 🛤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是</span><strong><span>我的生日</span></strong><span>🎂，也</span><strong><span>祝你</span></strong><span>今天愉快～🌷☕️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚞 - 导 航 轴 - 🧭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 开场：年更主播「生日特辑」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 三十岁才是真正的</span><strong><span>“成年人”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🪞〔回顾三十岁〕🎞️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 在闲鱼买了辆二手新能源车，非要去那个</span><strong><span>“钱少事多离家远”</span></strong><span>的班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 恭喜我的猫们，可以养活自己了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a> 每到节假日，情绪大崩溃</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🏠〔独立2年，我的改变〕🛋️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> </span><strong><span>「情感独立」</span></strong><span>不再对我妈的所有情绪负责</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> </span><strong><span>「经济独立」</span></strong><span>不再为身为子女而抱歉愧疚</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️‍🔥〔三十一岁重生之 大年初一拉黑我妈〕📵</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 这年不过了，以后都不想这么过了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 2025，</span><strong><span>Being ＞ Doing：</span></strong><span>干不完，就不干了✌️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">30:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a> 建议大家，趁早享福（=把当下的快乐，咂巴尽味儿了！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> </span><strong><span>活着真有意思啊！</span></strong><span>幸亏坚持了几个春天~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 在下一个春天等你 🌱</span></p><span></span><p><span>坚持不住的时候，来听听我吧—— 如果我从破破烂烂，到开满鲜花💐</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，</span><strong><span>你也可以</span></strong><span>❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈公益机构/指路：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G0QJzAmUopMB5Q_DQr4AlA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G0QJzAmUopMB5Q_DQr4AlA"><span>陪你心理</span></a><span>（可线上）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📱如有需要，可添加小助手（relaxrexian）具体详询</span></p><span></span><p><span>不开心的时候，来看看我们的🐱吧——全网🔍 </span><strong><span>豆来咪🌈</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🍠： </span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ec86590000000000101e564?xsec_token=YBRJGpyF4W83_VBoyQ2V_Hk3djZVGoYnQyEt9RQH1Uaqo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6405abaa000000001f033b3a&amp;apptime=1743177362&amp;share_id=f471a128c3934347a2003b0e5f8ada2f" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ec86590000000000101e564?xsec_token=YBRJGpyF4W83_VBoyQ2V_Hk3djZVGoYnQyEt9RQH1Uaqo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6405abaa000000001f033b3a&amp;apptime=1743177362&amp;share_id=f471a128c3934347a2003b0e5f8ada2f"><span>豆来咪🌈</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🫘</span><strong><span>：</span></strong><span>豆来咪🌈</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤍 不要放弃，再为自己，坚持一次。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlK0IMFPorAoXPMfbpGNFGANB2CK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FldF7iQUbx92Psnoms469WQByMLz.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu4kWw8TxuiFtB2J9Xjg2-gcAp3n.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎼 BGM：苏运莹-生活倒影</span></p>]]></description>
