  <item>
    <title>Vol.005 被确诊“留几手”「不支棱综合征」：开始做事，怎么这么难?!</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6734735443dc3a438750d5f3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6734735443dc3a438750d5f3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 09:38:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这是一期 来自 [中秋节] 的延迟内容……</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>11月，已经在追令人上头的“离婚综艺”（再见爱人4）了，竟和（刘爽）“留几手”深深共鸣起来了……原来我也被困在</span><strong><span>「薛定谔的失败」</span></strong><span>里——</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>只要我“不努力”，就=不会失败！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>（有些）人，最怕的是：努力证明自己——真 的 不 行！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>且不提“三分钟热度”，怎么打</span><strong><span>「开始」</span></strong><span>做一件事，就这么</span><strong><span>「难」</span></strong><span>啊?!</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管你是不是这样，本期播客都适合来听听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你今天愉快～🌈☕️</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚞</span><strong><span> - 导 航 轴 - </span></strong><span>🧭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 姜思达躺着录播客，因为《他是“姜思达”》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 启动困难，难的是</span><strong><span>「心理压力」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 永远</span><strong><span>一边寻找意义，一边消解意义</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 郑钦文、李娜，那些</span><strong><span>目标感/意义感</span></strong><span>很强的人，太吸引我！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 当代“情绪孔乙己”：你也是</span><strong><span>「纯烦」</span></strong><span>那种人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 我总在设想被别人“评判”“选择”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a></span><strong><span>「努力」=「吃苦」</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 确诊</span><strong><span>「刘爽·综合征」</span></strong><span>=薛定谔的失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 被“成功学”洗脑，人洗废了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 职场不内耗了，结果生活处处内耗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> </span><strong><span>虚无感</span></strong><span>如同</span><strong><span>“强酸”</span></strong><span>，消解一切支持与意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a>「耐心」是我没能长结实的</span><strong><span>人格特质</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a>「极端思考」是“启动困难”的致命原因之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> 每项“未完成”的清单，都如同钉在我心墙的铁规</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">28:16</a> </span><strong><span>对「自我能力」的评估</span></strong><span>：时常在“自卑”与“自负”间横跳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 彩蛋，哈哈</span><em><strong><span>（不建议尝试）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>🎼 BGM：The Middle-Dream Tunes</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关注我们的【心理】公众号吧——【陪你心理】（peinixinlixa）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>❤️如有需要，亦可添加</span><strong><span>小助手（relaxrexian）</span></strong><span>申请公益咨询~（西安本地+全国线上）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liaTIOUyzxjQZSLrNaEI0eWXx-kg.m4a" length="60558146" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpt93BQYjF7z0yCUOOUbJ0n4uX-q.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.004 打工人防身指南｜裁员赔偿，亲历经验谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6682a83a077b88831b80f054</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6682a83a077b88831b80f054</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2024 12:59:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>来了！这是一期🐦 拖拖拖…更2年的</span><strong><span>超!干!货!</span></strong><span>播客——</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️《打工人防身指南｜亲，劳动法了解一下》📖</span></p><span></span><p><span>建议配合🎙️ </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628a3ccf4940904a62354b54" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628a3ccf4940904a62354b54"><span>如何带散一个团队| 试用期被辞退！浅复盘</span></a><span> 一起收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>P.S.</span></strong><span> 以下内容</span><strong><span>纯个人经历</span></strong><span>梳理，如有疏漏，欢迎留言区指出！🙏</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>✌🏻🥳 🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚞</span><strong><span> - 导 航 轴 -</span></strong><span> 🧭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 本期由来：试用期内无故被裁，据理力争，拿到赔偿💰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 「工作</span><strong><span>5年</span></strong><span>，裁赔</span><strong><span>2次</span></strong><span>」人在职场混，哪能……不防身！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> “初裁”体验：</span><strong><span>怕</span></strong><span>，但要</span><strong><span>战</span></strong><span>！💪🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 全体uu注意⚠️ </span><strong><span>签合同</span></strong><span>，须看清！✍️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 比</span><strong><span>赔偿金</span></strong><span>更重要的，是</span><strong><span>自我保护</span></strong><span>意识的觉醒！🙆🏻‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 不要轻易放弃</span><strong><span>捍卫自己</span></strong><span>的合法权益❗️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 【画重点】💡新人/法律小白“自救”的</span><strong><span>「6种方法</span></strong><strong><span>」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> 【上干货】🚨常见劳动争议/职场乱象</span><strong><span>「5大场景」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> （</span><strong><span>题外话</span></strong><span>）😿心理医生劝我辞职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> （</span><strong><span>我请问呢</span></strong><span>）😹</span><strong><span>“职场玉玉，算工伤吗？</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a> ①【合同】</span><strong><span>不签、不给 劳动合同</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> ②【社保】</span><strong><span>转正后再/不交社保、社保缴纳不够数</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> ③【加班】</span><strong><span>无偿、长期加班</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> ④【调岗降薪】</span><strong><span>公司说啥，就是啥</span></strong><strong><span>？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> ⑤【被裁】</span><strong><span>同意赔，但</span></strong><strong><span>你先回吧❓不同意赔，直接明天不用来了⁉️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> </span><strong><span>未战而退：</span></strong><span>你不试试，怎么知道呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2634">43:54</a> 聊聊，你说咱</span><strong><span>“打工”</span></strong><span>到底</span><strong><span>图个啥❓</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h4><strong><span>你的旷野、我的轨道，无非都是这花花“草台班子”的一部分而已</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>工作可以是自己做的，上班也可以是给老板看的——</span></p><span></span><h4><span>但生活永远都是自己的！🌈🌈🌈</span></h4><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h4><span>🧩 6种方法（皆可搜索“关键词”）</span></h4><span></span><p><span>① 公众号文章（概知《劳动法》框架）</span></p><span></span><p><span>② 豆b小组（上班这件事/职场体验讨论小组）</span></p><span></span><p><span>③ d音科普（袁律师教你打劳动仲裁/爱笑的廖律）</span></p><span></span><p><span>④ 播客（可搜索关键词）</span></p><span></span><p><span>⑤ 小红s</span></p><span></span><p><span>⑥ hr好友/职场前辈【🦸🏻‍♀️身边特别“勇”或E人uu～】</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚨 </span><strong><span>5大场景（据个人实际情况，按上述方法检索或咨询）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>⏯️ </span><strong><span>（试用期）裁员：谁提议，谁举证</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1.试用期考核标准（入职前，了解清，合同写明）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.能力不足的证据（养成“工作留痕”的好习惯）</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏯️ </span><strong><span>被约谈，记得问：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1) 是要辞退我吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2) 是什么理由辞退我？</span></p><span></span><p><span>3) 你的【评定标准】是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>4) 我们在【合同】中明确约定了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>5) 本月工资/奖金/绩效如何结算？</span></p><span></span><p><span>总之，没拿到</span><strong><span>【辞退通知书】绝不走‼️</span></strong><span>正常打卡上、下班。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏯️ </span><strong><span>强迫非本人意愿“调岗/薪”：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>若公司未经你本人签字同意（须变更劳动合同），直接给你降薪/调岗了，拿着劳动合同+工资流水，去仲裁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📚 播客提及内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>《下班回复微信，算加班吗？》</span></em><span>阅读原文</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/61VhCKPUpflpzIBGwBbNKw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/61VhCKPUpflpzIBGwBbNKw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>☎️ 法律援助中心12348</span></p><span></span><p><span>☎️ 市民热线12345</span></p><span></span><p><span>其他部门机构：</span><strong><span>人社局、劳动监察大队</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>☔️ 失业金/补助金</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJVTshTtuao53rHKLgdZe5j6pBj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>你搜哇！啥都有！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🪴 社保</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《社会保险法》明确规定，用人单位应当自用工之日起30日内为其职工申请办理社保登记。单位不给交社保，员工有权要求补缴，也可以随时单方解除劳动合同，并要求一定的经济赔偿。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💻 调岗调薪</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在司法实践中，虽然用人单位往往会在劳动合同中约定“因生产经营需要调整劳动者岗位的，劳动者应无条件服从”或“劳动合同履行期间，用人单位有权调动或变更劳动者岗位”，但是</span><strong><span>该约定应属无效条款</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>调岗降薪是对劳动合同的根本变更，根据《劳动合同法》第三十五条规定：“用人单位与劳动者协商一致，可以变更劳动合同约定的内容，变更劳动合同，应当</span><strong><span>采用书面形式</span></strong><span>。” 因此，用人单位要调岗降薪</span><strong><span>必须和劳动者协商一致，否则就属于违法。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💰 裁员赔偿</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>n+1：【1=代通知金】</span></strong><span>提前30天通知，或支付前一个月的工资（标准是根据劳动者被解除劳动合同的</span><strong><span>上个月</span></strong><span>工资为标准，不是前十二个月的月平均工资）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（+1，</span></strong><span>只适于</span><strong><span>“协商”</span></strong><span>解除）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>协商/合法 解除：n+1】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>第36条，用人单位主动提出的协商解除；</span></p><span></span><p><span>第38条，劳动者被迫解除劳动合同；</span></p><span></span><p><span>第40条，用人单位无过错解除劳动合同；</span></p><span></span><p><span>第41条，用人单位经济性裁员。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【无赔偿，仅限以下情况】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1、劳动者在</span><u><strong><span>试用期</span></strong></u><span>被证明不符合录用条件的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、劳动者严重违法用人单位的规章制度的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、劳动者严重失职，营私舞弊，给用人单位造成重大损失的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、劳动者同时与其它用人单位建立劳动关系，对完成本单位的工作任务造成严重，或者经用人单位提出，拒不改正的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>5、劳动者以欺诈、胁迫的手段或者乘人之危，使用人单位在违背真实意思的情况下订立或者变更劳动合同的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>6、劳动者达到法定退休年龄</span></p><span></span><p><span>🇨🇳 ⚖️ 最后，请大家周知：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>不管啥公司的啥“霸王”条款—— 任何合同/约定，都不能违反国家强制性法律法规！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期见啦～886 🐈</span></p>]]></description>
