  <item>
    <title>Vol.003 人到春天｜30岁了就会好吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660637942d9eae5d0abf40f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660637942d9eae5d0abf40f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Mar 2024 03:37:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我25岁之后的每个生日愿望，都是「一步跨进30岁」！</span></p><span></span><p><span>好像这个迷人的年龄，自带技能魔法：</span><strong><span>三十不惑</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>三十而立</span></strong><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>果真如此吗？我渴望逃离的、不敢面对的究竟是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管是新路人还是老朋友，感谢你的收听 🛤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是我的生日🎂</span></p><span></span><p><span>也祝你今天愉快～🌷☕️</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚞 </span><strong><span>- 导 航 轴 - 🧭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 这不是！一档【年更】播客！🌚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 去年「生日播客」仍持续收到</span><strong><span>新留言</span></strong><span>📮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> &nbsp;如果我在改变，那么你也可以🪴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>“爱吃苦的孩子，有苦吃。”</span></strong><span>🙂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> “我20多岁的时候，非常不快乐。”</span><em><span>（宋佳&amp;陈数）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 《为什么我们感觉不像成年人？》🤔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 「头脑暴政」：你为什么容易被</span><strong><span>pua</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 我有「ADHD」⁉️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> 被爱滋养，会长出一颗</span><strong><span>“耐心”</span></strong><span>❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 在所有的杂音中，坚定地站在自己这边🌊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 从</span><strong><span>“金钱羞耻”</span></strong><span>到我恬不知耻地和咨询师说……💰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">32:44</a> </span><strong><span>“毒性羞耻”</span></strong><span>是如何伤害我们的？【新栏目预告】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> </span><strong><span>寿星祝福 </span></strong><span>大、放、送！听者有份～🔮</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈 公益机构/指路：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3OTIwMTE4OA==&amp;mid=2247489157&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6825eb1213d71116608b47cd5c751675&amp;chksm=cf09484ef87ec158da0b6fff998d536dbcde151aad923839b152271d69a2e48a7c0893866253&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=1&amp;srcid=0329s4xnsdE2RPWRwCdB4KT2&amp;sharer_shareinfo=3572140ecc0ad54281f74e1889c958a2&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=3572140ecc0ad54281f74e1889c958a2#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3OTIwMTE4OA==&amp;mid=2247489157&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6825eb1213d71116608b47cd5c751675&amp;chksm=cf09484ef87ec158da0b6fff998d536dbcde151aad923839b152271d69a2e48a7c0893866253&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=1&amp;srcid=0329s4xnsdE2RPWRwCdB4KT2&amp;sharer_shareinfo=3572140ecc0ad54281f74e1889c958a2&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=3572140ecc0ad54281f74e1889c958a2#rd"><span>思捷青年</span></a><span>（可线上）</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️如有需要，可添加小助手（relaxrexian）具体详询</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎼 BGM：</span></strong><span>Doria-Ólafur Arnalds</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇🏻哭得很惨，但猫好幸福！📸</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpLwVt8NvsEro4Qf9lt0cTAEE1Vh.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
