  <item>
    <title>Vol.002 挺过这个春天｜关于抑郁症</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6421ca858aca9099d778be89</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6421ca858aca9099d778be89</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Mar 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>前述</span></strong><span>🙇🏻‍♀️：这期收听效果不太好😰，我已经来来回回修改3遍+了。。。还是有</span><strong><span>音轨错位&amp;延迟</span></strong><span>。。。太烦了😫 之后会更换剪辑软件（请大家多多包涵！🫠</span></p><span></span><p><span>*有盆友留言说，想要节目最后那段儿「生日备忘录📝」～okk</span></p><span></span><p><span>我放在show notes辣～蟹蟹你的收听与喜欢 🥰</span></p><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>🪴</span></p><span></span><p><span>春天当然很好，</span></p><span></span><p><span>可除了有新芽与明艳外，为什么不能有：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>坦诚的脆弱、旧疾的复发，和求救的信号？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果就是无法和许多“别人”一样，愉悦地歌颂春之美呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果“开心一点”，就是“难于上青天”呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果我又被“black dog”追上，拖入情绪的了沼泽呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>那你听见我的求救了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>—— 请你和我一起，挺过这个春天吧！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTAX3qhzHMbBJ8A9AfpmYQ3SmB1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🚞 - 导 航 轴 - 🧭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 【冷知识*1】</span><strong><span>春天才会「抑郁」复发</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> </span><em><span>“孩子啊，冬天太冷了，不如我们等到春天再s吧。”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《黑暗荣耀2》#房东奶奶江边救东恩 </span></em><span>🌊🥹</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一、确 诊 前 后｜抑郁 &amp; 焦虑</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 我因失恋，也成了“废物花痴”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 「只缓5分钟，能哭1小时」！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 并非“手机有多好玩儿”，而是“深夜会让我更焦虑”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 【冷知识*2】</span><strong><span>人类并非生来就会自主入睡</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> 从一线</span><strong><span>“逃”</span></strong><span>回家乡后——我撒过的那些谎🫥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 工作稳定，病情确诊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二、心 理 “话” 疗｜2 个 moments✨分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> ① 不击穿妈妈的</span><strong><span>「认知自洽」</span></strong><span>，是我最大的温柔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> ② 即便无法成为一棵理想的</span><strong><span>“大树”</span></strong><span>，也要试着接受自己与众不同的天分～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三、《服 药 记 录》｜请大家！谨遵医嘱！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> 正是那些“爱我的人”，让我感觉“不配”这样“失败”地活着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">27:07</a> </span><em><strong><span>“人这一辈子，能用上几个‘大道理’啊！”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a> 第一次服药反应：🫠副作用大到以为自己吃错了药！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> “阳康”后遗症：“失去味觉”，因祸得福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a>【严肃警告】⚠️ </span><strong><span>服 药 谨 遵 医 嘱 ‼</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>四、“挺过” 这个春天</span></strong><span>｜2 个 m</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 你的任何情绪，都值得被</span><strong><span>看见</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>宽慰</span></strong><span>，它不是</span><strong><span>“多余”</span></strong><span>，你更不必</span><strong><span>“羞耻”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a> </span><strong><span>关于睡眠：</span></strong><span>2个小点，1个钩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> </span><strong><span>关于焦虑：</span></strong><span>那些具而微的琐事，才是</span><strong><span>“生命补丁”</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>“崖边绳索”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 这场漫长的疫情“结束”了吗？那我的“病情”它会好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> 关于我</span><strong><span>《28岁的生日备忘录》📝</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 今天！🎂</span><strong><span>《29岁的生日愿望》</span></strong><span>是……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最后，请你和我一起，挺过这个春天！🌻</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvyEIhyec7FxCpSP82KhtloyGX2a.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>附 文 部 分：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>⚠️ </span><u><span>请大家在确诊之后，一定要</span></u><u><strong><span>按时吃药、复诊、遵医嘱。</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span>🚫 </span><u><strong><span>绝不可：</span></strong></u><u><span>私自停药，或自行改量——易引起机体不适，导致再次复发或更严重后果 !!!</span></u></p><span></span><p><span>📖 </span><em><strong><span>《防 抑郁反扑 行动手册》 </span></strong></em><span>🔮</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1、关于“强迫型熬夜”——对明天有期待：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（1）想好明早，吃什么；</span></p><span></span><p><span>（2）准备好，明天的衣服。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2、保持运动：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>身体分泌的内啡肽和多巴胺，都会帮助你抵抗抑郁</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>* 如果你实在不爱动，可以像我一样做做拉伸、瑜伽</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3、直接行动：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>让手脚动在脑子和情绪之前，会很大程度缓解未知、迷茫带来的焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎶 </span><u><strong><span>本期 BGM：</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><u><strong><span>插曲/ </span></strong></u><u><span>艾怡良- Forever Young</span></u></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FozLQ5W2x3t3Aw8Jkn36hWsCJ7ab.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg85GAuXSBaSHw9xSDmWHg1-H1hZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FreNRPtlllMux6WLqRvkLYp91gRh.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>💫 </span><em><span>本次旅程告一段落，感谢你的陪伴，那 我们下期再见！bye～ &nbsp;</span></em><span>🙌🏻</span></p>]]></description>
