  <item>
    <title>Vol.001 快30了，竟还找不到“北”｜可人生并非轨道，而是旷野</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640f2dd3092eb63cb086a484</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640f2dd3092eb63cb086a484</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Mar 2023 14:06:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【😥 up碎碎念】04.01-更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果在收听过程中，感觉“奇怪的停顿”“错位的bgm”……</span></p><span></span><p><span>是因网页剪辑bug（或其他蜜汁因素8！</span></p><span></span><p><span>好几次*n，想删掉重录，还是算了8 😮‍💨《接受不完美》是当下课题</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你能多多包涵🫡</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多时候，回头看看我们走过的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会发现这样的事实：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「人生不是轨道，是旷野。」</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>没人能“拒绝”旷野吹来的风</span></p><span></span><p><span>就像没人能“拒绝”自己的人生的剧本、当下的角色……</span></p><span></span><p><span>可你不知这阵风，到底从“何处”、又是在“何时”而来的</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌬️ 当我们置身这片旷野中，当起风时——</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我还能做点什么、该怎么做？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🔮 这就是本期，我想要和你 探讨&amp;分享的话题～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FidHaOMLxuRVUsmL2TTWgoIXp36t.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🥳 # 再次拥抱老朋友们～也热烈欢迎新朋友们滴关注！👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌲【很开心，能与你同路一段。】🚞</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🛤️ - &nbsp;导 航 轴 - 🧭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 《三观找北》是啥意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 化学老师：“西安迷路，就找钟楼。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 《风中的“确定性”》又是啥意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> “计划型思维” vs “直觉型思维”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> ① 计划周全、② 追求完美、③ 严重内耗—— 是你吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 第一步= 山路十八弯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 关于《一个绝世伟大作品》的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">17:59</a> 我们为何总想在别人的经验里“避坑”“取经”“寻找支点”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 克服「想太多，做太少」bug，你需要——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">18:59</a> 关于《我朋友“胖胖”的故事》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> “画大象”（抖音up @彤姐很忙）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> 「完成每个阶段的确定性，抓住你能获得的一切」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 「你就是这样逐渐平庸，且一事无成的」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 常伟思：“整个人类世界都是偶然。”（《三体》剧版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> 一个尾声，及下期预告～</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>-------- 分割线 --------</span></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6184c2ff58d36d5f13400516" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6184c2ff58d36d5f13400516"><span>推荐小宇宙播客@脑袋空空</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/61ecd7ebab975b0640c5519c/640f2dd3092eb63cb086a484/9.74%20oQx:/%20%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E6%8A%96%E9%9F%B3%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%8B%E7%9C%8B%E3%80%90%E5%BD%A4%E5%A7%90%E5%BE%88%E5%BF%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E5%93%81%E3%80%91%E6%88%91%E8%BF%87%E5%8E%BB%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%88%90%E9%95%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%88%E4%BD%9B%E6%82%9F%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B4%BB%E7%9D%80%E5%88%B0...%20https://v.douyin.com/SqLHssT/" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/61ecd7ebab975b0640c5519c/640f2dd3092eb63cb086a484/9.74%20oQx:/%20%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E6%8A%96%E9%9F%B3%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%8B%E7%9C%8B%E3%80%90%E5%BD%A4%E5%A7%90%E5%BE%88%E5%BF%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E5%93%81%E3%80%91%E6%88%91%E8%BF%87%E5%8E%BB%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%88%90%E9%95%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%88%E4%BD%9B%E6%82%9F%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B4%BB%E7%9D%80%E5%88%B0...%20https://v.douyin.com/SqLHssT/"><span>本期“画大象”原视频@彤姐很忙</span></a></p>]]></description>
