    <title>如何带散一个团队| 试用期被辞已赔！浅复盘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628a3ccf4940904a62354b54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">628a3ccf4940904a62354b54</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 May 2022 13:38:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>试播期，也是我的一篇</span><strong><span>《被辞述职》</span></strong><span>之《作为团队中一员，我是如何被“反向领导”带垮的》🌚</span></p><span></span><p><span>是恶意职场pua？还是纯暴力沟通？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是领导无方？还是我患上了“职场/双向/情感障碍”⁉️ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>总之，没必要为他人的错误买单；</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;也别老在自己身上找问题啊！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚞 - 导 航 轴 - 🧭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> &nbsp;概述：试用期内 被辞退，拿到赔偿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> &nbsp;《被辞述职》之“反向领导”如何带散一个团队（三点论证） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>第一/待人：</span></strong><span>坚持【对人不对事】原则 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> &nbsp;① 面试警惕！“表演型”人格领导！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> &nbsp;② 我被贴上了“职场·双向情感障碍”标签？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>第二/话术：</span></strong><span>营造【全暴力沟通】氛围 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> &nbsp;① 前后</span><strong><span>5个设计</span></strong><span>，全部主动离职——品牌部，竟无甲方自己设计⁉️&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> &nbsp;② 开眼（演）了，这才是真正的</span><strong><span>“废话文学”</span></strong><span> &nbsp;🫡</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>第三/处事：</span></strong><span>【以身作则式*双标】+【亲力亲为式*过河拆桥】 🙂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>“准点下班，好说不好看。” &nbsp;⏰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> &nbsp;“嗯…这怎么不算</span><strong><span>「亲手洗稿」</span></strong><span>呢？” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后！欢迎订阅俺滴频道，嘻嘻！~</span></p>]]></description>
